# The keys that terminals keep for themselves.  This is a part:
# the Reference Manual includes it with the Include marker (appendix D,
# "Which terminals keep which keys"), and it is a document of
# its own that can be opened, printed and kept up to date by itself.  The
# facts are those of the study of the keys of the environments: a row is a
# terminal that was run and probed.
